{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52727","headline":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 二 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛，六星近在河岸头。\n头上虽然有两角，腹下从来欠一脚。\n牛下九黑是天田，田下三三九坎连。\n牛上直建三河鼓，鼓上三星号织女。\n左旗右旗各九星，河鼓两畔右边明。\n更有四黄名天桴，河鼓直下如连珠，罗堰三乌牛东居。\n渐台四星似口形，辇道渐台在何许，欲得见时近织女。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}